<title>RUSSIA: LUKoil sees H1 pre-tax profit around 1.4 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>LUKoil sees H1 pre-tax profit around 1.4 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>NK LUKoil, Russia's biggest oil company recorded a consolidated pre-tax profit in the first half of this year of around 1.4 trillion roubles according to preliminary data, Vice-President Leonid Fedun said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Fedun did not give comparisons for 1995, but told a news conference detailed figures would be issued next week.</p>
</text>
